    ["找寻预言之物，窥见真相，逃离噩梦——\n<P_Yellow>一物藏匿，羔羊归家之音不再奏响。</>\n<P_Yellow>一物收存，新生之种，葬于石像之侧。</>\n<P_Yellow>一物隐蔽，绯红月辉照耀其上。</>\n……\n……\n新生者，再次新生。\n十九次，{{他|她}}已在梦中死亡十九次。\n这一次，是{{他|她}}的第二十次噩梦。\n{{他|她}}翻开本不该出现在此的，安提哥努斯笔记。\n然后，死于笔记的力量导致的失控。\n新生者，再次新生。\n这一次，是{{他|她}}的第二十一次噩梦。\n……\n新生者再次见到安提哥努斯笔记。\n{{他|她}}没有翻开笔记，而是抽走一张⬛⬛牌。\n……\n新生者来到插满鲜花的祭坛前，决定做点什么。\n新生者的内心，萌生出弄明白真相的强烈渴望。\n{{他|她}}观察祭坛，获得一张记载预言的羊皮纸。\n新生者将按照预言的启示……"] = "Seek the object of prophecy, glimpse the truth, and escape the nightmare—\n<P_Yellow>One object hidden, the sound of the lamb returning home no longer plays.</>\n<P_Yellow>One object stored, the seed of rebirth, buried beside the stone statue.</>\n<P_Yellow>One object concealed, the crimson moonlight shines upon it.</>\n...\n...\nThe newborn is reborn once more.\nNineteen times, {{he|she}} has already died in the dream nineteen times.\nThis time is {{his|her}} twentieth nightmare.\n{{He|She}} opens the Antigonus Notebook, which should not have appeared here.\nThen, dies from the loss of control caused by the notebook's power.\nThe newborn is reborn once more.\nThis time is {{his|her}} twenty-first nightmare.\n...\nThe newborn sees the Antigonus Notebook again.\n{{He|She}} does not open the notebook, but instead draws a ⬛⬛ card.\n...\nThe newborn arrives before the altar filled with flowers and decides to do something.\nA strong desire to understand the truth grows within the newborn's heart.\n{{He|She}} observes the altar and obtains a piece of parchment recording the prophecy.\nThe newborn will follow the revelation of the prophecy...",
